window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Vampire Hunter D continues his quest to overcome the interstellar evil brought to earth by the ultimate Noble, the terrifying renegade vampire Valcua! <br><br>Wielding a sword that can cut through the fabric of space and time, Valcua has a score to settle with the bloodline of humans responsible for his exile. <br><br>The family has enlisted D to protect them from Valcua's wrath, and the vampire hunter might be their only chance at survival.<br><br>Adapted from the novel and produced with a full cast of actors, immersive sound effects and cinematic music!<br><br>Performed by Scott McCormick, David Cui Cui, Terence Aselford, Christopher Williams, Rayner Gabriel, Shanta Parasuraman, RJ Bayley, Yasmin Tuazon, Matthew Bassett, Wyn Delano, Bradley Foster Smith, Christopher Walker, Colleen Delany, Danny Gavigan, Donald Guzzi, Drew Kopas, Eric Messner, Jeri J. Marshall, and Nora Achrati.</p>"; 
